settled Matthias 2026-11-07: bars 15-16 ("Freude uns macht"), A (Schott 1900) has A4:4 G#4:2 F#4:2 / E4:4 R:2, B (de.wikipedia, moved +2) has A4:4 F#4:2 D#4:2 / E4:6; the two prints end differently, and it is not verified which ending is Schulz's and which is Eickhoff's; Zitro plays the old print's version, and a second reading of A's scan confirmed A.
